+<B>,</B> <A HREF="sched_setscheduler.html"><B>sched_setscheduler</B>(3)</A>
+<B>,</B> the Base Definitions volume of IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001,
+<I>&lt;sched.h&gt;</I> 
+</P>
