+     /*
+      * ------------------------------------------------------
+      * DOCPUBLIC
+      *      Destroys a barrier attributes object. The object can
+      *      no longer be used.
+      *
+      * PARAMETERS
+      *      attr
+      *              pointer to an instance of pthread_barrierattr_t
+      *
+      *
+      * DESCRIPTION
+      *      Destroys a barrier attributes object. The object can
+      *      no longer be used.
