+ *      59 Temple Place - Suite 330, Boston, MA 02111-1307, USA
+ *
+ * --------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ *
+ * Test Synopsis: Test running of user supplied terminate() function.
+ *
+ * Test Method (Validation or Falsification):
+ * - 
+ *
+ * Requirements Tested:
+ * -
+ *
+ * Features Tested:
+ * - 
+ *
+ * Cases Tested:
+ * - 
+ *
+ * Description:
+ * - 
+ *
+ * Environment:
+ * - 
